}

docs {
  # Approve Proposal (Kaprodi Context)
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `POST /api/proposal-review/:type/:id/approve`
  
  Melakukan persetujuan proposal di stage `kaprodi`.
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token (Kaprodi / Admin)  
  **Permission Required:** `approve_proposal_kaprodi`
}
